Z||000000||DXR_DAD||01-26-2001||01:13 AM||||This is the Custom Built Parts Dryer or pig roaster?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> It's LP and Elect. This should take care of all the baking, drying, and heating of any parts.<P>What do you guys think?<BR>Powder Coating!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Bar-B-Q  Anyone??<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723593&p=39158209&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723593&p=39158304&Sequence=0&res=high"> <p>[This message has been edited by DXR_DAD (edited 01-26-2001).]||||reg||1
